---
title: "Sale Lifecycle (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_prefund: initialize(), prefundStartTime reached
    q_prefund --> q_prefund_alloc: prefundEndTime reached
    q_prefund_alloc --> q_active: startTime reached
    q_active --> q_refund: endTime reached
    q_refund --> q_results: refundEndTime reached, publishSaleResults()
    q_results --> q_supply: supplyTokens()
    q_supply --> q_distribute: tokens supplied
    q_distribute --> [*]: all claims processed

    q_prefund --> q_cancel: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_active --> q_cancel: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_cancel --> [*]: investors call withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()

    note right of q_prefund
        INV-001: prefund (1h-12w) -> allocation -> active (1h-12w) -> refund (1h-2w) -> results -> supply -> distribute
        INV-002: cancel possible before results publication
        INV-003: each stage has strict time boundaries enforced on-chain
    end note

    note right of q_results
        INV-004: withdrawRaisedCapital requires tokensSupplied == true
        INV-005: claimTokenAllocation requires tokensSupplied == true
        INV-006: withdrawExcessInvestedCapital requires results published
    end note
